I reach the office.
I go inside.
My colleague Rohan is at his desk.
He is working on the computer.
I say to Rohan, "Good morning, Rohan!"
Rohan smiles and says, "Good morning, Maya!"
I ask, "How are you?"
He says, "I am fine."
"There is a lot of work today."
I go to my desk.
I sit on my chair.
I put my bag on the table.
Then, I turn on my computer.
The screen is turning on.
Now I am opening my email.
I am reading new emails.
I am typing a new email.
Everyone in the office is working.
I am also starting my work.
